          "notes": "Scholarly Work published in 1994 under ATU 5 and ADFU 15. The publisher reports Robert K. Englund with a contribution by Rainer M. Boehmer. Nissen 2024 identifies numerical-only tablets omitted from ATU 1 as later published within ATU 5; the ATU 2 numerical-systems analysis has a separate Work identity. Publisher coverage of approximately 820 documents and CDLI’s 897 related artifacts are dated, source-specific observations."
